## Research status

Self-excluded (`.md.excluded`): no extractable verified public benchmark numbers were confirmed for the exact model identity `baidu/ernie-5.5-flash` / "ERNIE 5.5 Flash" in this run. I found official Baidu ERNIE pages for **ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview** (released 2026-11-11 on ernie.baidu.com), which describe a 280B-total / 14B-active model with 1M-token context and present benchmark results as images/tables on the release page. However, the benchmark values were not available as extractable text in the fetched content, and the preview name/identity may differ from the non-preview `ernie-5.5-flash` folder identity. To avoid inventing or misattributing scores, no scored findings file is created.

## Verified observations (non-benchmark)

- **Closest official public release found:** ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview (Baidu ERNIE site, 2026-11-11). Page states 280B total parameters, 14B active parameters, 1M-token context, strengths in coding/3D modeling/knowledge work/content creation, and API availability on Qianfan; weights noted as to be open-sourced under Apache 2.0 soon.
- **Identity caution:** "ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview" is not identical in name to "ERNIE 5.5 Flash"; benchmark attribution must be exact. Project metadata in this repo describes ERNIE 5.5 Flash as 280B/14B sparse MoE with 1M context and Qianfan pricing, but metadata claims were not treated as verified benchmark evidence.

